    "20f850852413abb1165f3f7ca95b4831a0e90a34ae7c7fcb41c44b108d3513c3": {
      "note": "Dictionary cores3-telemetry-v2. The digest does not cover the LIVE keys. Every build from 9371f6b (Arduino firmware v5, which added LIVE) through 38a7c33 (native idf-cores3-parquet-v6.8) hashes telemetry_fields.inc to this digest and sends the same keys on real hardware. The list is hardcoded in firmware/arduino-m5unified/bringup/telemetry_logger.cpp up to 791ed72 and in firmware/common/logger/src/aq_logger.cpp from a1a12b3. utc is event_time_utc_ns, nanoseconds on the wire as in every later build.",
